	gnupg [label=gnupg "binary:Synopsis"="GNU privacy guard - a free PGP replacement" Breaks="[[{\"name\": \"debsig-verify\", \"op\": \"<<\", \"version\": \"0.15\"}], [{\"name\": \"dirmngr\", \"op\": \"<<\", \"version\": \"2.4.8-4ubuntu3\"}], [{\"name\": \"libgnupg-interface-perl\", \"op\": \"<<\", \"version\": \"0.52-3\"}], [{\"name\": \"libgnupg-perl\", \"op\": \"<=\", \"version\": \"0.19-1\"}], [{\"name\": \"libmail-gnupg-perl\", \"op\": \"<=\", \"version\": \"0.22-1\"}], [{\"name\": \"monkeysphere\", \"op\": \"<<\", \"version\": \"0.38~\"}], [{\"name\": \"php-crypt-gpg\", \"op\": \"<=\", \"version\": \"1.4.1-1\"}], [{\"name\": \"python-apt\", \"op\": \"<=\", \"version\": \"1.1.0~beta4\"}], [{\"name\": \"python-gnupg\", \"op\": \"<<\", \"version\": \"0.3.8-3\"}], [{\"name\": \"python3-apt\", \"op\": \"<=\", \"version\": \"1.1.0~beta4\"}]]" Description="GNU privacy guard - a free PGP replacement
 GnuPG is GNU's tool for secure communication and data storage.
