 .
 For more information see: https://wiki.gnupg.org/WKS" Enhances="[]" InstalledSizeKB=187 IsEssential=no Maintainer="Ubuntu Developers <ubuntu-devel-discuss@lists.ubuntu.com>" Origin="" Provides="[]" Recommends="[]" Replaces="[]" Section=utils "source:Package"=gnupg2 "source:Version"="2.4.8-4ubuntu3" Suggests="[[{\"name\": \"gnupg\", \"op\": \"=\", \"version\": \"2.4.8-4ubuntu3\"}]]" Version="2.4.8-4ubuntu3"]
