	"libpam0g:amd64" [label="libpam0g:amd64" "binary:Synopsis"="Pluggable Authentication Modules library" Breaks="[[{\"name\": \"libpam0t64\", \"op\": \"<<\", \"version\": \"1.5.3-5\"}]]" Description="Pluggable Authentication Modules library
 Contains the shared library for Linux-PAM, a library that enables the
 local system administrator to choose how applications authenticate users.
 In other words, without rewriting or recompiling a PAM-aware application,
 it is possible to switch between the authentication mechanism(s) it uses.
 One may entirely upgrade the local authentication system without touching
 the applications themselves." Enhances="[]" InstalledSizeKB=211 IsEssential=no Maintainer="Ubuntu Developers <ubuntu-devel-discuss@lists.ubuntu.com>" Origin="" Provides="[]" Recommends="[]" Replaces="[[{\"name\": \"libpam0g-util\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}], [{\"name\": \"libpam0t64\", \"op\": \"<<\", \"version\": \"1.5.3-5\"}]]" Section=libs "source:Package"=pam "source:Version"="1.7.0-5ubuntu3" Suggests="[[{\"name\": \"libpam-doc\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}]]" Version="1.7.0-5ubuntu3"]
	"libpango-1.0-0:amd64" [label="libpango-1.0-0:amd64" "binary:Synopsis"="Layout and rendering of internationalized text" Breaks="[]" Description="Layout and rendering of internationalized text
 Pango is a library for layout and rendering of text, with an emphasis
 on internationalization. Pango can be used anywhere that text layout is
 needed. however, most of the work on Pango-1.0 was done using the GTK+
 widget toolkit as a test platform. Pango forms the core of text and
 font handling for GTK+-2.0.
 .
 Pango is designed to be modular; the core Pango layout can be used with
 four different font backends:
  - Core X windowing system fonts
  - Client-side fonts on X using the Xft library
  - Direct rendering of scalable fonts using the FreeType library
  - Native fonts on Microsoft backends
 .
 This package contains the shared libraries." Enhances="[]" InstalledSizeKB=556 IsEssential=no Maintainer="Ubuntu Developers <ubuntu-devel-discuss@lists.ubuntu.com>" Origin="" Provides="[]" Recommends="[]" Replaces="[]" Section=libs "source:Package"="pango1.0" "source:Version"="1.57.0-1" Suggests="[]" Version="1.57.0-1"]
