	logsave [label=logsave "binary:Synopsis"="save the output of a command in a log file" Breaks="[[{\"name\": \"e2fsprogs\", \"op\": \"<<\", \"version\": \"1.45.3-1\"}]]" Description="save the output of a command in a log file
 The logsave program will execute cmd_prog with the specified
