	"lsb-release" [label="lsb-release" "binary:Synopsis"="Linux Standard Base version reporting utility (minimal implementation)" Breaks="[]" Description="Linux Standard Base version reporting utility (minimal implementation)
 The Linux Standard Base (http://www.linuxbase.org/) is a standard
 core system that third-party applications written for Linux can
 depend upon.
