	luit [label=luit "binary:Synopsis"="locale and ISO 2022 support for Unicode terminals" Breaks="[[{\"name\": \"x11-utils\", \"op\": \"<<\", \"version\": \"7.7+6\"}]]" Description="locale and ISO 2022 support for Unicode terminals
 Luit is a filter that can be run between an arbitrary application and a
