	"node-popper2" [label="node-popper2" "binary:Synopsis"="Javascript library to position poppers in web applications" Breaks="[]" Description="Javascript library to position poppers in web applications
 A popper is an element on the screen which \"pops out\" from the natural flow
 of your application.
 .
 This is version 2.x of the Popper library. The older 1.x version is
 available in libjs-popper.js. More recent versions have been renamed
 to Floating UI.
 .
