": \"mailagent\", \"op\": \"<<\", \"version\": \"1:3.1-81-2\"}], [{\"name\": \"perl\", \"op\": \"<<\", \"version\": \"5.40.1~\"}], [{\"name\": \"perl-modules\", \"op\": \"<<\", \"version\": \"5.40.1~\"}], [{\"name\": \"pod2pdf\", \"op\": \"<<\", \"version\": \"0.42-5.1\"}], [{\"name\": \"slic3r\", \"op\": \"<<\", \"version\": \"1.2.9+dfsg-6.1\"}], [{\"name\": \"slic3r-prusa\", \"op\": \"<<\", \"version\": \"1.37.0+dfsg-1.1\"}], [{\"name\": \"texinfo\", \"op\": \"<<\", \"version\": \"6.1.0.dfsg.1-8\"}]]" Description="minimal Perl system
 Perl is a scripting language used in many system scripts and utilities.
 .
 This package provides a Perl interpreter and the small subset of the
 standard run-time library required to perform basic tasks. For a full
 Perl installation, install \"perl\" (and its dependencies, \"perl-modules-5.40\"
