	"python3-argcomplete" [label="python3-argcomplete" "binary:Synopsis"="bash/zsh tab completion for argparse (for Python 3)" Breaks="[[{\"name\": \"python-argcomplete\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}]]" Description="bash/zsh tab completion for argparse (for Python 3)
