	rsyslog [label=rsyslog "binary:Synopsis"="reliable system and kernel logging daemon" Breaks="[]" Description="reliable system and kernel logging daemon
 Rsyslog is a multi-threaded implementation of syslogd (a system utility
 providing support for message logging), with features that include:
  * reliable syslog over TCP, SSL/TLS and RELP
  * on-demand disk buffering
  * email alerting
  * writing to MySQL or PostgreSQL databases (via separate output plugins)
  * permitted sender lists
  * filtering on any part of the syslog message
  * on-the-wire message compression
  * fine-grained output format control
  * failover to backup destinations
  * enterprise-class encrypted syslog relaying
 .
 It is the default syslogd on Debian systems." Enhances="[]" InstalledSizeKB=1840 IsEssential=no Maintainer="Ubuntu Developers <ubuntu-devel-discuss@lists.ubuntu.com>" Origin="" Provides="[[{\"name\": \"linux-kernel-log-daemon\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}], [{\"name\": \"system-log-daemon\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}]]" Recommends="[[{\"name\": \"logrotate\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}]]" Replaces="[]" Section=admin "source:Package"=rsyslog "source:Version"="8.2512.0-1ubuntu4" Suggests="[[{\"name\": \"rsyslog-doc\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}], [{\"name\": \"rsyslog-mysql\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}], [{\"name\": \"rsyslog-pgsql\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}], [{\"name\": \"rsyslog-mongodb\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}], [{\"name\": \"rsyslog-elasticsearch\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}], [{\"name\": \"rsyslog-kafka\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}], [{\"name\": \"rsyslog-hiredis\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}], [{\"name\": \"rsyslog-snmp\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}], [{\"name\": \"rsyslog-kubernetes\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}], [{\"name\": \"rsyslog-docker\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}], [{\"name\": \"rsyslog-clickhouse\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}], [{\"name\": \"rsyslog-openssl\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}, {\"name\": \"rsyslog-gnutls\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}], [{\"name\": \"rsyslog-gssapi\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}], [{\"name\": \"rsyslog-relp\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}], [{\"name\": \"apparmor\", \"op\": \">=\", \"version\": \"2.8.96~2541-0ubuntu4~\"}]]" Version="8.2512.0-1ubuntu4"]
