 Vim is an almost compatible version of the UNIX editor Vi.
 .
 This package contains files shared by all non GUI-enabled vim variants
 available in Debian.  Examples of such shared files are: manpages and
 configuration files." Enhances="[]" InstalledSizeKB=2271 IsEssential=no Maintainer="Ubuntu Developers <ubuntu-devel-discuss@lists.ubuntu.com>" Origin="" Provides="[]" Recommends="[[{\"name\": \"xxd\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}], [{\"name\": \"vim\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}, {\"name\": \"vim-gtk3\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}, {\"name\": \"vim-motif\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}, {\"name\": \"vim-nox\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}, {\"name\": \"vim-tiny\", \"op\": null, \"version\": null}]]" Replaces="[[{\"name\": \"vim-runtime\", \"op\": \"<<\", \"version\": \"2:9.0.1658-1~\"}]]" Section=editors "source:Package"=vim "source:Version"="2:9.1.2141-1ubuntu4.3" Suggests="[]" Version="2:9.1.2141-1ubuntu4.3"]
	"vim-runtime" [label="vim-runtime" "binary:Synopsis"="Vi IMproved - Runtime files" Breaks="[[{\"name\": \"vim-tiny\", \"op\": \"<<\", \"version\": \"2:9.1.2141-1ubuntu4.3\"}]]" Description="Vi IMproved - Runtime files
